Code, splits, predictions and the script that fills every number in this paper from the result files are at
\url{https://github.com/ShahmeerHyat/cpmg-memory-poisoning}. Every decision that affects the data, the model or the
evaluation is logged in \texttt{results/DECISIONS.md}.

